(7684514, 1258127, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and sort of dreamy, almost monochrome quality to this. Would personally prefer a little bit more sharpness on the sparrow''s head.</td>', 'I like the composition and sort of dreamy, almost monochrome quality to this. Would personally prefer a little bit more sharpness on the sparrow''s head.', '2021-01-15 12:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
