(7684516, 1257767, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the dewdrops on the spiderweb behind him, and the eye is nice and sharp. Kind of want a bit more DOF to get the rest of the head in focus, too.</td>', 'Love the dewdrops on the spiderweb behind him, and the eye is nice and sharp. Kind of want a bit more DOF to get the rest of the head in focus, too.', '2021-01-15 12:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
