(7684532, 1257904, 4008, '<td valign="top">What a large DOF! Focus stacking? Great colours. Very appealing.</td>', 'What a large DOF! Focus stacking? Great colours. Very appealing.', '2021-01-15 14:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
