(7684615, 1257892, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nicely done but it does not evoke any emotion with me. Technical point: The cup should have been moved slightly to the left so it was totally horizontal, symmetrical and in line with the saucers.</td>', 'Nicely done but it does not evoke any emotion with me. Technical point: The cup should have been moved slightly to the left so it was totally horizontal, symmetrical and in line with the saucers.', '2021-01-16 08:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684616, 1258129, 4008, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but the execution is not so good, if you intended to make this look real in any way. The light is equally flat on all elements, so that is o.k., but the sharpness/focus/blur is different throughout and to me makes it just of combination of elements but does not rise above that.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but the execution is not so good, if you intended to make this look real in any way. The light is equally flat on all elements, so that is o.k., but the sharpness/focus/blur is different throughout and to me makes it just of combination of elements but does not rise above that.', '2021-01-16 08:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684618, 1257767, 4008, '<td valign="top">Impressive colors and sharpness. I like how the spiderweb is adding some extra background.</td>', 'Impressive colors and sharpness. I like how the spiderweb is adding some extra background.', '2021-01-16 08:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684619, 1258093, 4008, '<td valign="top">Lovely shadows and patterns. Not sure whether the foreground is necessary.</td>', 'Lovely shadows and patterns. Not sure whether the foreground is necessary.', '2021-01-16 08:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684622, 1258133, 4008, '<td valign="top">If you manipulate an image (nothing against that) why not make sure you got the horizontals/verticals straight at the same time? It needs some clockwise rotation.</td>', 'If you manipulate an image (nothing against that) why not make sure you got the horizontals/verticals straight at the same time? It needs some clockwise rotation.', '2021-01-16 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
