(7684625, 1258150, 4008, '<td valign="top">I see the three layered panorama''s of the same scene from different standpoint but am not sure what you are trying to convey with this. Does not trigger anything with me other than this question.</td>', 'I see the three layered panorama''s of the same scene from different standpoint but am not sure what you are trying to convey with this. Does not trigger anything with me other than this question.', '2021-01-16 08:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
