(7685020, 1258136, 124815, '<td valign="top">Interestingly enough for me this image seems quite violent - the end of the battle where the upright dark blue figures on foot or on bike stepped and crushed almost unidentifiable colorful things. I quite like this effect enhanced by the fact that the image is not b&amp;w.<br/>On second thoughts...I''d try a B&amp;W</td>', 'Interestingly enough for me this image seems quite violent - the end of the battle where the upright dark blue figures on foot or on bike stepped and crushed almost unidentifiable colorful things. I quite like this effect enhanced by the fact that the image is not b&w.On second thoughts...I''d try a B&W', '2021-01-21 19:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
