(7685039, 1257767, 173844, '<td valign="top">Absolutely enchanting.  A bliss of green.  The detail is wonderful.  This little hopper looks like a gentleman in Parliament arising to make a point of order.  The majestic eye, dainty legs and feet, antennas, armor - revelatory.  The bedewed spider web bunting is an extraordinary backdrop.  The supporting leaf, or whatever, a magic carpet.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely enchanting.  A bliss of green.  The detail is wonderful.  This little hopper looks like a gentleman in Parliament arising to make a point of order.  The majestic eye, dainty legs and feet, antennas, armor - revelatory.  The bedewed spider web bunting is an extraordinary backdrop.  The supporting leaf, or whatever, a magic carpet.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-01-21 21:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
